<title>POLAND: Budimex 1996 group net at PLN 22.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Budimex 1996 group net at PLN 22.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Budimex SA said in a statement on Monday that its group net profit in 1996 was 22.9 million zlotys on a pre-tax profit of 29.6 million zlotys and on sales of 406 million zlotys.</p>
<p>Its group total revenues in 1996 were 545.8 million zlotys. The company gave no comparison figures.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
